### Staking event history for a locker

```graphql
query stakingHistory($locker: Bytes!, $first: Int = 100) {
  stakingEvents(
    where: { lockerStaking_: { locker: $locker } }
    orderBy: blockTimestamp
    orderDirection: desc
    first: $first
  ) {
    type
    amount
    newStakedBalance
    blockTimestamp
    transactionHash
  }
}
